WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.230 --> 00:00:04.560
It’s a perfect day for a wedding.

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:09.620
On a warm spring afternoon, a beautiful bride
and a handsome groom are exchanging the special

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:13.199
rings they had custom designed and made for
each other.

00:00:13.199 --> 00:00:18.230
As they take turns placing the rings on each
other's fingers, a man standing at the end

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:20.560
of the wedding party steps out of position.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.509
He approaches the groomsman next to him and
reaches into his jacket, taking out a pair

00:00:24.509 --> 00:00:27.070
of pliers that he hands to the groomsman.

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:32.180
The groomsman happily takes the tool and then,
without any hesitation, shoves the pliers

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:35.969
into his mouth and begins removing his teeth
one by one.

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:40.640
When he is finished, he hands the bloody teeth
to the man along with the pliers.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:44.760
The man then goes to the next groomsman who
repeats the same process.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:49.579
He continues going down the line until all
of the groomsmen and bridesmaids have removed

00:00:49.579 --> 00:00:54.109
their teeth, seemingly without pain or resistance.

00:00:54.109 --> 00:00:56.679
The man then approaches the bride and groom.

00:00:56.679 --> 00:01:01.120
He hands each of them half of the pile of
teeth, which they gladly accept.

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:06.540
They then begin to eat the teeth without delay,
seemingly not bothered by the intense damage

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:10.160
they’re causing to their own teeth and jaws
by doing so.

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:14.940
The man watches as the groom moves the priest
who was officiating the wedding aside.

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:20.190
As the entire church looks on in joy, the
groom opens his mouth and the deafening sound

00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:22.300
of cicadas are heard.

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:29.140
This is only the beginning of what the SCP
Foundation has labeled an SCP-2852 event,

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:33.671
a terrifying and little understood phenomenon
that is better known by the nickname of the

00:01:33.671 --> 00:01:36.430
anomalous creature responsible for them…

00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:37.910
Cousin Johnny.

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:42.100
The Foundation had been trying to contain
Cousin Johnny for decades - not that it’d

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:43.550
ever done them any good.

00:01:43.550 --> 00:01:48.280
Johnny is a Keter-Class anomaly that’s thus
far proven impossible to contain.

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:52.700
This is an entity so dangerous and volatile
that three different Mobile Task Forces are

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:59.720
devoted to detecting and disrupting its activities
- MTF Upsilon-36, aka The Party Crashers.

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:03.240
MTF Upsilon-52, aka Cater Duty.

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:06.660
And MTF Upsilon-99, aka The Altar Boys.

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:11.819
But so far all the Foundation has been able
to really do is swoop in afterwards and do

00:02:11.819 --> 00:02:15.459
their best to pick up the pieces of people’s
shattered lives.

00:02:15.459 --> 00:02:20.549
Cousin Johnny has so far been observed to
only operate in the North American subcontinent,

00:02:20.549 --> 00:02:25.769
and only seems to appear at Anglican or Catholic
baptisms, weddings, and funerals.

00:02:25.769 --> 00:02:30.150
However, Foundation operatives charged with
keeping a lid on Cousin Johnny harbor the

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:36.220
hidden fear that he may one day expand his
hunting grounds, and wreak terror worldwide.

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:42.569
If Johnny became multinational or multi denominational,
his violence, insanity, and pure evil may

00:02:42.569 --> 00:02:48.950
truly become impossible to minimize, so compatible
communities are constantly monitored for increased

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:54.489
levels of juvenile delinquency, sterility,
domestic violence, and divorce.

00:02:54.489 --> 00:02:58.970
After all this, you’re probably wondering:
Who or what actually is Cousin Johnny, and

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:01.480
how does he cause so much horrific tragedy?

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:05.599
At face value, nothing about the appearance
of Cousin Johnny would suggest an anomalous

00:03:05.599 --> 00:03:08.239
nature, or even any sort of danger.

00:03:08.239 --> 00:03:12.829
He appears to be a middle-aged white male,
often with scruffy hair and a beard.

00:03:12.829 --> 00:03:18.290
On a cellular level too, Cousin Johnny appears
all too human, but when you look at his physiology

00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:20.360
it’s a whole different story.

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:25.900
Cousin Johnny has no identifiable organs whatsoever
- his body is made out of a fibrous muscular

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:26.900
tissue.

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:31.159
The only exceptions are his teeth and hair,
which are made of a kind of chitin - a key

00:03:31.159 --> 00:03:36.340
component of insect exoskeletons, such as
those possessed by cicadas.

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:39.719
Johnny’s eyes are the first clue that something
is off about him.

00:03:39.719 --> 00:03:44.939
From a distance they appear perfectly normal,
but up close, they’re glassy and dead.

00:03:44.939 --> 00:03:49.069
This is because his eyes aren’t actually
attached to any nerves inside his head.

00:03:49.069 --> 00:03:55.099
With no nervous system or vocal chords, Johnny’s
ability to see, move, and talk defy any kind

00:03:55.099 --> 00:03:56.780
of logical explanation.

00:03:56.780 --> 00:04:00.969
His speech will seem completely normal to
the people under his spell, but to anyone

00:04:00.969 --> 00:04:05.959
else, it comes out as complete nonsense, often
described as word salad.

00:04:05.959 --> 00:04:10.629
If people in attendance are briefed in advance
about this phenomenon, whatever hypnotic ability

00:04:10.629 --> 00:04:15.319
causes them to hear his sounds as intelligible
words won’t work, and they’ll be aware

00:04:15.319 --> 00:04:17.799
of how nonsensical it all sounds.

00:04:17.799 --> 00:04:21.060
But of course, that doesn’t mean they’re
safe.

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:25.390
Cousin Johnny appears at family gatherings
and religious rituals, and immediately, he’ll

00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:27.860
be treated as though he’s always been there.

00:04:27.860 --> 00:04:29.460
You know your Cousin Johnny, right?

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:30.910
You go way back.

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:33.890
Or at least, you’re pretty sure you do.

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:36.290
Nothing will appear unnatural about his sudden
presence.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:41.290
In fact, if you’re one of the victims of
one of his incidents, chances are, you’ll

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:44.630
actually find yourself taking a shine to Cousin
Johnny.

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:48.980
Sure his sense of humor is a little crude
and raunchy, but you can’t help but enjoy

00:04:48.980 --> 00:04:50.070
his company.

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:54.160
He’s a fun guy to be around, and after all,
he’s family!

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:59.220
As previously mentioned, he’ll only appear
at three different kinds of events: Baptisms,

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:03.350
Weddings, and Funerals, and only at those
that are affiliated with either the Catholic

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:05.160
or Anglican religions.

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:10.690
The SCP Foundation has classified baptisms
that Cousin Johnny attends as Blue Level Events,

00:05:10.690 --> 00:05:15.250
Weddings are known as White Level Events,
and Funerals are Black Level Events - with

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:19.750
each one escalating in severity, violence,
and horror.

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:22.760
First, Baptisms - the Blue Level Events.

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:27.701
In these events, Cousin Johnny will appear
and begin to act as a third godparent, despite

00:05:27.701 --> 00:05:30.100
there traditionally only being two.

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:34.400
As the infant is lowered into the holy water,
the entirety of their top layer of skin will

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:36.830
come off, like a molting snake.

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:40.950
Despite looking horrific, this apparently
causes no harm to the child.

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:45.190
The godparents will then eat this discarded
skin, as though it’s the most normal thing

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:46.350
in the world.

00:05:46.350 --> 00:05:50.390
After this, the family will leave the church
together, and Cousin Johnny will leave with

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:51.390
them.

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:54.040
He won’t appear at any subsequent celebrations
of the child’s baptism.

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:55.040
If this is where it ended, it’d be extremely
gross - but not exactly a living nightmare.

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:58.350
Of course this is just the beginning of the
terror.

00:05:58.350 --> 00:06:02.030
Following Cousin Johnny’s appearance at
the baptism, the child’s risk of dying in

00:06:02.030 --> 00:06:07.250
the next six months skyrockets, and if they
survive, they’re at an increased risk of

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:10.570
becoming unstable and violent later on in
life.

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:15.020
Their parents and godparents will both become
unable to conceive any further children, and

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:19.590
are likely to be found dead from drowning
within five years of the event.

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:24.080
Those who were only tangentially involved
in the baptism ritual have a massively increased

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:29.120
chance of failed pregnancies, or - if they
do conceive - they may become a danger to

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:30.840
their offspring.

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:34.860
Children who live through Blue Level Events
and survive past adolescence, will experience

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:39.480
adverse side effects when encountering the
songs of cicadas well into adulthood - from

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:43.900
experiencing physical sickness to going through
dangerous psychotic episodes.

00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:48.150
Weddings, or White Level Events, are more
complex and severe.

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:52.580
In this case, Cousin Johnny will insert himself
into the wedding as a groomsman, and the most

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:57.130
horrifying events will begin to take place
after the vows have been exchanged.

00:06:57.130 --> 00:07:01.390
Johnny will provide various implements that
allow the bridesmaids and groomsmen to remove

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:06.550
their teeth, which are then given to the bride
and groom to eat - which they do, causing

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:09.770
severe damage to their own teeth in the process.

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:15.730
The groom will then vocalize an unknown cicada
call at an incredible volume, as loud as 140

00:07:15.730 --> 00:07:20.940
decibels in some instances, rendering the
bride and everyone else near the altar completely

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:22.030
deaf.

00:07:22.030 --> 00:07:25.640
At the wedding reception, where everyone is
continuing to behave as if northing out of

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:30.640
the ordinary is happening, Cousin Johnny will
ruin things further by giving the best man’s

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:31.640
speech.

00:07:31.640 --> 00:07:35.050
The speech is more of his typical complete
nonsense, though if you’re there you’ll

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:39.570
never realize this, and think that this is
the best speech you’ve ever heard, with

00:07:39.570 --> 00:07:44.050
some in the audience laughing hysterically
while others cry uncontrollably.

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:47.700
Once his speech is done, he’ll present a
gift to the newly married couple…

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:53.190
3.5 kilograms of human hair in various colors,
13 deceased specimens of a certain cicada

00:07:53.190 --> 00:07:57.910
known as Linne's cicada, and 23 human teeth
in a cardboard box.

00:07:57.910 --> 00:08:02.210
DNA tests on all gifts have been inconclusive
as to their origin.

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:06.880
Much like many celebrity marriages, unions
that occurred during White Level events never

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:12.700
last, and all end up divorced within two years
- often as a result of domestic violence,

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:17.270
and any children born during their brief marriage
will be violent and unstable.

00:08:17.270 --> 00:08:20.920
But it’s not just the wedding party that
gets to experience the fun of a visit from

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:22.200
Cousin Johnny.

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:26.580
All married individuals who attended the wedding
will find that they are unable to conceive

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:30.170
children, despite no biological indicators
of infertility.

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:33.960
Any children present at the White Level Event
will show no interest in romance throughout

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:38.599
their life, and often die tragically before
reaching the age of eighteen.

00:08:38.599 --> 00:08:44.269
Finally, and most horrifying of all, are funerals
- or Black Level Events.

00:08:44.269 --> 00:08:48.480
While Blue and White Level Events can potentially
be disrupted before they are completed, lessening

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:53.860
or preventing the horrific results, there
is as yet no way to stop or prevent a Black

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:56.329
Level Event at any stage.

00:08:56.329 --> 00:09:00.490
Any attempts to prevent Cousin Johnny from
entering the church or funeral home will lead

00:09:00.490 --> 00:09:02.949
to him simply manifesting inside.

00:09:02.949 --> 00:09:07.170
Once in the room where the funeral is taking
place, Cousin Johnny will first take up the

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:12.199
role of eulogizer and begin speaking his standard
nonsense to the attendants.

00:09:12.199 --> 00:09:16.410
The person who was emotionally closest to
the departed will then open the casket, if

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:21.140
this was not already an open casket funeral,
and will then produce a large knife.

00:09:21.140 --> 00:09:25.180
It’s unknown where the knives come from
as they’re not present before the event

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:26.839
and they disappear after.

00:09:26.839 --> 00:09:31.569
The funeral attendees will then use the knife
on their wrists and sometimes throats, draining

00:09:31.569 --> 00:09:33.660
their blood into the coffin.

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:39.011
Many lose more than enough blood to result
in death, but none ever die from this, nor

00:09:39.011 --> 00:09:42.420
do they seem to feel any pain from their wounds.

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:46.790
As the attendees take turns bleeding into
the coffin, Cousin Johnny continues his eulogy

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:52.540
which eventually evolves into a cicada song,
the kind sung by Linne’s cicada males.

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:57.079
The attendants sing the same song back to
him in a kind of call and response.

00:09:57.079 --> 00:10:01.670
Cousin Johnny will then approach the coffin
and vomit in a mixture of blood, wood pulp,

00:10:01.670 --> 00:10:03.260
and dead cicadas.

00:10:03.260 --> 00:10:07.980
The funeral will then proceed as normal, and
the blood, vomit, and cicada filled casket

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:11.100
is then taken to the cemetery and buried.

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:15.310
Black Level Events will usually end with the
body being interred in the ground, but if

00:10:15.310 --> 00:10:19.800
there’s a wake after the funeral, the horrors
of the Black Level Event will continue.

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:25.050
At the wake, Cousin Johnny will climb on top
of a table, lie down, and encourage the other

00:10:25.050 --> 00:10:31.610
attendants to devour him, which they do - all
while he continues to talk his nonsense.

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:33.800
Until there is nothing left.

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:39.269
Much like Blue and White Level events, being
in attendance leads to horrific after-effects.

00:10:39.269 --> 00:10:43.370
All participants who experience this event
will separate from their family through either

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:46.309
suicide, moving, or divorce.

00:10:46.309 --> 00:10:50.410
Every individual present at the event will
also find that they are no longer able to

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:55.199
produce offspring, and couples present may
also fall victim to incidences of domestic

00:10:55.199 --> 00:11:01.309
violence, often involving cannibalism, that
usually leave one or both participants dead,

00:11:01.309 --> 00:11:06.120
while six out of ten children involved will
attempt to murder one or both of their parents

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:08.480
before they turn eighteen.

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:13.269
These Black Level Events are so horrible for
all involved, that any members of the specialized

00:11:13.269 --> 00:11:17.800
Cousin Johnny Mobile Task Forces that happen
to witness such an event are treated with

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:23.189
Class-A amnestics before they are transferred
to another task force or retire, to ensure

00:11:23.189 --> 00:11:26.850
that they don’t have to live with the memories
of what they saw.

00:11:26.850 --> 00:11:31.310
Prior to that, they are closely monitored
for any strange or anti-social behavior to

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:33.680
make sure they weren’t affected by the event.

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:38.370
And they aren’t the only SCP Foundation
staff at risk of having been impacted by Cousin

00:11:38.370 --> 00:11:39.370
Johnny.

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:43.579
It is theorized that as many as a third of
Catholic and Anglican D-Class personnel were

00:11:43.579 --> 00:11:49.160
involved in a Black-Level event at some point,
and were driven to madness and violence by

00:11:49.160 --> 00:11:53.970
their fateful brushes with the strange relative
that no one knows.

00:11:53.970 --> 00:11:58.640
So next time you’re at a baptism, or a wedding,
or a funeral, stay vigilant.

00:11:58.640 --> 00:12:01.119
Keep an eye on the other guests.

00:12:01.119 --> 00:12:05.930
And always ask yourself: Do you really have
a Cousin Johnny?

00:12:05.930 --> 00:12:11.630
But since you’re already here, go check
out “SCP - 3001 - Red Reality” and “SCP

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:14.769
- 4205 - In The Eyes of The Beholder” for
more!

